{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01JREqhKyLYhezuZXKuZt9Vt","type":"tool_result","content":"╔════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  ASCII ART DRAWING APPLICATION        ║\n║  Child-Friendly Shape Editor           ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n=========================================\n  ASCII ART DRAWING APPLICATION\n=========================================\n1. View all available shapes\n2. Create new scene\n3. Add shape to scene\n4. Remove shape from scene\n5. View scene\n6. List all scenes\n7. Save scene\n8. Load scene\n9. Compare two shapes\n10. Compare two scenes\n11. Delete scene\n12. Exit\n=========================================\nChoice: \n=== Available Shapes ===\n\n1. Tree:\n    /\\    \n   /  \\   \n  /____\\  \n  /    \\  \n /______\\ \n    ||    \n    ||    \n\n2. Tractor:\n      ________     \n     |        |___ \n     |  []  []|   |\n  ___|________|___|\n /  o        o   \\\n|___|        |___| \n\n3. House:\n     /\\     \n    /  \\    \n   /____\\   \n   |    |   \n   | [] |   \n   |    |   \n   |____|   \n\n4. Sun:\n  \\  |  / \n   \\ | /  \n--- (@) ---\n   / | \\  \n  /  |  \\ \n          \n          \n\n5. Cloud:\n   _____       \n  /     \\_    \n /  ___  _\\  \n(__/   \\_)   \n\n6. Flower:\n  \\|/  \n -(@)- \n  /|\\  \n   |   \n   |   \n  / \\  \n /   \\ \n\n7. Car:\n  ____       \n /|_||_\\____ \n( o     o  ) \n -----------  \n\n8. Star:\n    *    \n   ***   \n  *****  \n ******* \n*********\n\n9. Heart:\n *** ***  \n*********  \n*********  \n ******* \n  *****  \n   ***   \n\n10. Rainbow:\n      _______      \n    /         \\    \n   /           \\   \n  /             \\","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c9f0b1e-d5e4-477f-a5a5-c2a84f8e5b73","uuid":"b557fa96-65ca-45f0-ae11-f996d27e1359","timestamp":"2026-05-30T01:34:06.645Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"╔════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  ASCII ART DRAWING APPLICATION        ║\n║  Child-Friendly Shape Editor           ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n=========================================\n  ASCII ART DRAWING APPLICATION\n=========================================\n1. View all available shapes\n2. Create new scene\n3. Add shape to scene\n4. Remove shape from scene\n5. View scene\n6. List all scenes\n7. Save scene\n8. Load scene\n9. Compare two shapes\n10. Compare two scenes\n11. Delete scene\n12. Exit\n=========================================\nChoice: \n=== Available Shapes ===\n\n1. Tree:\n    /\\    \n   /  \\   \n  /____\\  \n  /    \\  \n /______\\ \n    ||    \n    ||    \n\n2. Tractor:\n      ________     \n     |        |___ \n     |  []  []|   |\n  ___|________|___|\n /  o        o   \\\n|___|        |___| \n\n3. House:\n     /\\     \n    /  \\    \n   /____\\   \n   |    |   \n   | [] |   \n   |    |   \n   |____|   \n\n4. Sun:\n  \\  |  / \n   \\ | /  \n--- (@) ---\n   / | \\  \n  /  |  \\ \n          \n          \n\n5. Cloud:\n   _____       \n  /     \\_    \n /  ___  _\\  \n(__/   \\_)   \n\n6. Flower:\n  \\|/  \n -(@)- \n  /|\\  \n   |   \n   |   \n  / \\  \n /   \\ \n\n7. Car:\n  ____       \n /|_||_\\____ \n( o     o  ) \n -----------  \n\n8. Star:\n    *    \n   ***   \n  *****  \n ******* \n*********\n\n9. Heart:\n *** ***  \n*********  \n*********  \n ******* \n  *****  \n   ***   \n\n10. Rainbow:\n      _______      \n    /         \\    \n   /           \\   \n  /             \\","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
